WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.920
In Capernaum, friends lower a
paralysed man through a roof,

2
00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.730
and Jesus heals him.

3
00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:10.660
Yet by chapter 3 of Mark, his opponents
are already plotting against him.

4
00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:15.420
Later, in Jerusalem, he drives the
traders out of the Temple courts.

5
00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:19.600
Soon the chief priests are
looking for a way to destroy him.

6
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:23.890
So why did powerful people
want a healer and teacher dead?

7
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:27.150
In this mission, you'll meet the
groups who clashed with Jesus,

8
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.380
and what each one cared about.

9
00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:34.050
Then you'll ask how Christians today
should read these clashes fairly.

10
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:38.390
Your mission: find out why
powerful people wanted Jesus dead,

11
00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:40.910
when he healed people
and taught about God.
